{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEVEL UP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit one of <strong>3 classes</strong> of hero to enter the mountain and collect Foepower from the growing horde of corrupted monsters. Receive <strong>dynamic level-up choices</strong>, hunt for <strong>powerful equipment</strong>, and bump into <strong>unique encounters</strong> offering a fresh and fun level up experience for each playthrough.<br><br>Your recruited hero runs go from Level 1 to Level 30, designed for <strong>quick in-and-out gameplay</strong>. Each round of <strong>auto-battling exploration</strong> takes 30-90 seconds, with the total run requiring less than 30 minutes. Your run to level 30 is timed during active combat, offering a <strong>speed run competition</strong> versus your own best performances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BRINKMANSHIP! (How far will YOU push it?)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll have to balance how careful or aggressive to be, as you balance <strong>harvesting Foepower</strong>, experience, and loot, versus escaping <strong>increasingly difficult monsters</strong> and the <strong>effects of the mountain's corruption</strong>. As you gather more Foepower, you can <strong>invest in troupe-wide Foepower traits</strong> to strengthen all your heroes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TEST YOUR CHAMPIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At level 30, your heroes compete to become an <strong>arena champion</strong>. In the arena, you can <strong>battle increasingly strong bosses</strong>, and gain <strong>additional arena level up powers</strong>.<br><br>You can also test your newest hero versus your best hero of that class (Warrior, Mage, or Inquisitor). Its a <strong>king of the hill match</strong> - the best wins and can <strong>loot an item from the fallen</strong>.<br><br>Your arena champions can also train new recruits allowing for a type of <strong>multi-classing hero</strong>, enabling new gameplay variations.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survival of the Swordsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/527ee00c07fd3bd04febe673e20f26cd2c0ab76e.jpg"},{"name":"Mastery of Magics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/2ce41063357de0f7aecd5e0d5f938b3f93c3b8f9.jpg"},{"name":"Longevity of Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/f7825293871e6ae80376b826210cf4e0b9a202bc.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Pacer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/736c1eb4dd53bc44e348f55ec63aa60d70db1609.jpg"},{"name":"Extractor Grande","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/1c350398b543c4647c93c191c5c7acaf65943291.jpg"},{"name":"Surfs Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/fe1ade76ba37e4b61a388b02af9e13c9f4e12bbf.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Foepowered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/5eb22bdc447f1806a187eea54e0c7ec708a7cd08.jpg"},{"name":"Clutch Reactor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/fe3b870906db9a9b1cb85e5f34eae79daeaf2082.jpg"},{"name":"Kinseeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/f307447f5cc9a898e3ad7a31a7052f6bfeae973d.jpg"},{"name":"Super Stones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395850/f5e6f021ccee2bdaacb2a4f33beefdd6f17694f0.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395850?t=1742913306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742913306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395850/d26a11e2885615